  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="005ac12a-3ae8-5bfa-a4a4-d0c22e9c93c1" activityNameId="7f663e56-f3f2-59f3-8480-12504e7dfc38" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Crude oil, at production onshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Crude oil, at production onshore
The onshore oil production delivers the product crude oil. The values are derived from a multioutput-process "combined onshore gas and oil production" by allocation based on heating values for crude oil and natural gas UUID=3d1a0d74-c2d5-3462-8d3f-8f83c009ac1b
Production of crude oil including energy use, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: Data valid for SA.
Technology: 35 % offshore and  65 % onshore production
Time period: Time of most relevant publications and statistics. Other generic data, e.g. for infrastructure are based on older publications.
Production volume: 348 megatons of crude oil per year in 2023.
Sampling: Statistics and use of generic data
Extrapolations: A part of the data has been estimated with generic assumptions for onshore production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3d1a0d74-c2d5-3462-8d3f-8f83c009ac1b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="d39e31ca-949c-5ea2-9de3-6536de93b586" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">SA</shortname>
